:''Not to be confused with [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Inspector Gabriel]].''
'''Gabriel''' (天使ガブリエル, ''Tenshi Gaburieru'', '''Angel Gabriel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Doge]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.7 Update|Version 2.7]].

