==Enemy==
Gabriel differs from [[Doge Dark]] by having lower attack power and range in exchange for Area Attack, more health and faster movement speed, allowing him to take down stacks of cats easily. As he is outranged by all [[Cat Units]], he will usually move forward a little after killing a unit, meaning that if you don't knock him back, he will keep inching closer and closer until he reaches the [[Cat Base]].

==Strategy==
If this enemy is sent out rapidly and in hordes, he can be very annoying. Try to not let him take advantage of his many knockbacks by killing him with few, powerful blows.

You can use any cat with high damage or DPS like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], etc., while defending with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cats]] to exploit his Angel trait.

