==Trivia==
*He shares his name with the archangel [[wikipedia:Gabriel|Gabriel]].
*"Sleeping in class earns a bite from the old man" may be a reference to how, in Japanese, the "Gabri" in Gabriel sounds like がぶり ''gaburi'' (onomatopoeia for a large bite; chomping).
*Despite being introduced later, he is listed before [[Heavenly Hippoe]] in the [[Enemy Guide]].

